# chopi GitHub allowlist
#
# Injects the host's GitHub token ONLY for entries matching the allowlist.
# git-pushing to any repo requires a matching entry, and so does any access to a private repo.
#
# Fetching/cloning any PUBLIC repo works regardless of this list.
#
# One entry per line, naming a repository on github.com (the "github.com/" prefix is implicit),
# in one of two forms:
#   owner/*      -- any repository under that owner or org
#   owner/repo   -- exactly that repository
#
# Examples (uncomment / edit):
# owner/*
# owner/repo
